---
import MarketingLayout from "../../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
import { urls } from "../../lib/urls";
---
<MarketingLayout
  title="Restaurant POS for Saudi Arabia"
  description="Vyfoo for restaurants in Saudi Arabia: configurable VAT workflows, currency setup, and hardware options for QSRs, cafés, and multi-outlet groups."
  path="/solutions/saudi-arabia"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/solutions">Solutions</a> / Saudi Arabia</p>
      <h1>Restaurant operations for the Saudi Arabian market.</h1>
      <p>Vyfoo supports configurable VAT workflows and SAR currency setup for restaurants and restaurant groups operating in Saudi Arabia.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What's configurable today</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>VAT-related billing workflows, configured per your registration</li>
        <li>SAR currency display and calculation</li>
        <li>Standard restaurant hardware (tablets, Android POS, thermal printers)</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What requires confirmation</h2>
      <p>
        Arabic-language interface and bilingual receipt requirements, ZATCA e-invoicing specifics, and local payment
        or aggregator integrations should be confirmed and scoped with our team rather than assumed from this page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="container cta-split">
      <div><h2>Discuss your Saudi Arabia rollout</h2></div>
      <a class="btn btn--on-ink btn--lg" href={urls.bookDemo}>Book Enterprise Demo</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
